  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#aeb1aa">start simply</div>
    <h2>one class. one hour. one moment for yourself.</h2>
    <p>join a live class for $10. no membership required.</p>
    <p class="small">a monthly unlimited plan can come later.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="start-actions">
    <a class="btn rose" href="#calendar">book a class · $10</a>
